#422
A Dirt Path~
You stand on a small dirt path that meanders its way through the grassy
plains.  Small songbirds fly back and forth, singing and searching for smaller
bugs to snack on.  The grass sways back and forth in the wind, and the scent
of flowers is in the air.  To the east, small hills rise up from the fields.
You sight rooftops a little ways off to the east.
